            <p>prism.css is the resting material. light.js is optional: it solves the field, reads density (<code class="prism-data">data-light</code>), materials (<code class="prism-data">data-material</code>) and events (<code class="prism-data">data-light-event</code>), and exposes <code class="prism-data">light.setRig()</code>. Agents read the same rules as <a href="/prism/PRISM.md">PRISM.md</a>.</p>
