    <footer class="ds-footer">
      <p>
        PRISM v0.9 · all color OKLCH · passive light by radiance cascades (<a href="https://radiance.wiki/">radiance.wiki</a>) ·
        <a href="/prism/PRISM.md">PRISM.md</a> · <a href="/prism/prism.tokens.json">tokens</a> · <a href="/prism/prism.css">prism.css</a> · <a href="/prism/light.js">light.js</a>
      </p>
      <p>
        Contrast audit (WCAG AA): <code>scripts/prism-contrast-audit.mjs</code> checks the body-text pairs at hues
        <code>{`{20, 60, 90, 150, 185, 260, 310}`}</code> in both modes. It also checks text on the field under the
        light at its worst: every day channel at its 0.8 floor (≥ 8.1:1) and a full night glow (≥ 5.6:1). The 60–90° band
        is the known risk zone, and it passes.
